"""Public package interface for TensorAtlas.

The package root intentionally avoids eager imports.  Most implementation
modules depend on SymPy and geometry registries; importing all of them from
``tensoratlas`` made simple imports and test collection prone to long shutdown
latency.  Public names are resolved lazily through ``__getattr__``.
"""

